      "content": "that's a good start and accurately summarizes the core idea, but it's a bit too short for our library requirements. the current score for that snippet is pretty low because of the character count. \n\ncan you expand on this significantly? specifically, try to go into the mathematical derivation using wavefunctions or discuss the implications for the concept of \"trajectories\" in more depth. i really need this to be a massive, comprehensive section—aim for much more length so it actually hits a high score in the system, but again, please keep it substantive. i don't want to see the same sentence reworded ten different ways, just actually dive deeper into the physics.",
